  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marketing/Storage/Processing: Reducing climate vulnerability and emissions through sustainable livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to increase the productive capacities and market participation of poor rural and indigenous families, particularly women and youth, as well as to reduce the emission of GHG, by promoting resilient and sustainable production systems in order to improve livelihoods in the Balsas Basin</narrative>
  </description>
